title: Coalition Outreach
subtitle: Reach beyond the base.
tags: party_action
new-page: true
view-if: outreach_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; outreach_timer = 2

= Coalition Outreach

The Democratic coalition has gaps. Where do we invest our time?

- @rural: Rural and small-town America.
- @labor: Unions and the industrial Midwest.
- @latino: Latino and Asian American communities.
- @independents: Independents, former Republicans, and suburbanites.

@rural
subtitle: A long game. Strong effect on House and Senate down-ballot.
on-arrival: pop_mod += 0.2; mod_strength += 2; mod_dissent -= 3; maga -= 1; funds -= 1 if funds >= 1

Showing up is half of it.

@labor
subtitle: Rebuild the labor wing.
on-arrival: labor_strength += 3; labor_dissent -= 5; pop_mod += 0.2; prog_dissent -= 1

Union halls remember who actually walked their picket lines.

@latino
subtitle: Shore up and grow a key bloc.
on-arrival: pop_mod += 0.3; enthusiasm += 1; unity += 1

Organizers talk to voters in their languages, about their own priorities.

@independents
subtitle: Moderates and suburbanites respond to competence.
on-arrival: pop_mod += 0.3; mod_strength += 2; prog_dissent += 2; media_trust += 1

Tone, not just substance.
